# Reports the planned run without compiling it or touching output files.
# Covers PDB, Amber, and GROMACS inputs, JSON errors and warnings, PME,
# minimization, NVE/NVT/NPT, nonperiodic cells, and every output kind.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_preflight.py mdir %S/../.. %t | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=JSON
# RUN: mdir check %t/amber.toml | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=AMBER
# RUN: mdir check %t/risky.toml 2> %t/warnings | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=RISKY
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=WARN < %t/warnings
# RUN: mdir check %t/minimize.toml | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MIN
# RUN: mdir check %t/none.toml | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NONE --implicit-check-not='density:' --implicit-check-not='box:'
# RUN: mdir check %t/active.toml 2> %t/active.warnings | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ACTIVE
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=EXISTS < %t/active.warnings
# RUN: mdir check %t/pull.toml 2> %t/pull.warnings | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PULL
#
# JSON: preflight JSON, warnings, units, and read-only checks passed
# AMBER: particles: {{ *}}4905
# AMBER: ensemble: NPT
# AMBER-NEXT: integrator: VELOCITY_VERLET, 500000 steps of 0.002 ps
# AMBER-NEXT: run length: 1 ns
# AMBER: barostat: C-RESCALE, ISOTROPIC, 1 atm
# AMBER: electrostatics: PME
# AMBER-NEXT: PME grid: automatic, max spacing 1.2 Å, order 4
# AMBER-NEXT: PME beta: automatic, tolerance 1e-05
# AMBER: constraints: {{[0-9]+}} distances; hydrogen bonds yes, rigid water yes
# AMBER-NEXT: target: gpu, mixed precision
# AMBER: trajectory: {{.*}}run.dcd (DCD), every 5000 steps
# AMBER-NEXT: checkpoint: {{.*}}run.h5 (H5MD), every 50000 steps
# RISKY: ensemble: NVE
# RISKY: run length: 0.02 ns
# RISKY: energies: stdout (stdout), disabled
# WARN: warning: 'rebuild_interval = 20' skips validity tests
# WARN: warning: the run writes no checkpoint
# WARN: warning: 'energy_interval = 0' disables energy reports
# MIN: ensemble: MINIMIZATION
# MIN-NEXT: minimizer: STEEPEST_DESCENT, 2000 steps
# MIN-NOT: run length:
# MIN: checkpoint: {{.*}}min.h5 (H5MD), at the end
# NONE: boundary: NONE (no periodic cell)
# ACTIVE: input checkpoint: {{.*}}earlier.h5 (not loaded by check)
# ACTIVE: trajectory: {{.*}}frames with "quotes".xtc (XTC), every 10 steps, exists
# EXISTS: warning: trajectory output '{{.*}}frames with "quotes".xtc' already exists
# EXISTS: warning: input checkpoint '{{.*}}earlier.h5' does not exist yet
# PULL: pull_coordinates: {{.*}}pull.dat (columns), every 20 steps, exists
